{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0333_1000_p", "source_sha256": "34c17a338c3365e9492752ebe58feeea8d029179014faabffdcc5e091dd8e12e", "ja": "（今日は音楽フェスティバルに参加している。未来は\nフラッグを振って、マーチングバンドを盛り立てた！）", "zh": "（今天参加了音乐节。未来挥舞着旗子，为行进乐队加油助威！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0333_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "2fab80514dc433de0c1530d25502a4fcbdab88696bd32c5a3a497ef09b945d62", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お待たせしました～。\nみんなと話してたら、着替えに時間がかかっちゃって。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让您久等啦～\n因为和大家聊了会儿天，换衣服就花了不少时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0333_1002_p", "source_sha256": "58b0cf52699ceadaeeb5b5967aec00c0ece8427c4b6f80b221a95d8e1b5684de", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、まだ時間はあるからな。\nそれより今日のパレードはすごい盛り上がったな！", "zh": "没关系，时间还充裕呢。\n比起那个，今天的游行真是超级热闹啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0333_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "064b85589217f3b3440ea4732d45bc00436a8928e1ea3a413b7f85937a32d1b4", "ja": "そうなんです！　それでパレードの話をしてて……\nあっ！　{$P$}さん、知ってますか？", "zh": "就是啊！然后我们正聊着游行的事……啊！{$P$}先生，您知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0333_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "eb62542ec9c3ffda5e48c1d9454421c679531f8bbf0138b3275f0c1e8d5ee761", "ja": "ロコちゃんに聞いたんですけど……私がやった\n旗を持つ人のこと『カラーガード』っていうんですね！", "zh": "我问了ROCO，原来我演的那个拿旗子的人叫“彩旗队”啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0333_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "ff67f2fcbdf191c24655e763f32948961f10af033c54cb6ffb70deb510eb377e", "ja": "『カラーガード』って、色を守るって意味ですよね？\nでも旗を振るんですよね……なんでだろう？", "zh": "“护旗手”是指保护颜色的意思吧？\n但明明是在挥旗子呀……为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0333_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9a8d4168b988ff86feb338d799c81c67e29cc6a7e1dac8c692b338a097128fcb", "ja": "『カラーガード』の『カラー』は、国旗や軍旗のことを\nいうらしい。大事な旗を護衛する人が由来みたいだ。", "zh": "『カラーガード』中的『カラー』，好像是指国旗或军旗。\n据说这个词源自护卫重要旗帜的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0333_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "f118271e46ea53f7cb57d232fcc633bab80fc6cd63334f4fbd0540a547b54aa4", "ja": "わあ～。{$P$}さん、物知りですね！\n楽器の中に、なんで旗があるのか不思議だったんです。", "zh": "哇～。{$P$}先生，您真博学啊！我一直觉得奇怪，乐器里怎么会有旗子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0333_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "ed20b53125b2c17b25c1ccaa0185a5aa61041ea6ec15ad375daaacd0053bb3f0", "ja": "あ、でも。音楽に合わせて動くのは楽しかったですよ♪\n見てる人も笑顔で……私、夢中で振っちゃいました！", "zh": "啊，不过，配合音乐动起来真的很开心哦♪  \n看的人也都笑了起来……我一不小心就挥得入迷了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0333_1009_p", "source_sha256": "eb9dc213a81e6202277bad0a493eea50c5fd334ac65ba995bb26ea5bc7ab9e17", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだったぞ！\nいつも元気な未来を、旗振り役にして正解だったな。", "zh": "啊，做得非常棒！\n让总是活力满满的未来来负责挥旗，果然是正确的选择。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0333_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "9e68d6addf217e71428ee7ccc6f382ba862db98c4f09135f768ffd305e8ce624", "ja": "でへへ～♪　バッチリな役、ありがとうございまーす！\nさすが、{$P$}さんですね～。", "zh": "嘿嘿～♪谢谢您给我这么棒的角色！不愧是{$P$}先生呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0333_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "b6117dec358fab427279fd6639e7e7ca3db07177414df936e96b8d4275e1b5cd", "ja": "って、ああっ！　もうすぐステージがはじまっちゃう！\n{$P$}さん、見に行きましょうっ！", "zh": "不过，啊啊！舞台马上就要开始了！\n我们去看{$P$}先生吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0333_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "bb5a3760838e7f57ecb9739c22a58f62b160b656114d435be9e3c4a7d4ed26cc", "ja": "貴音さんの琴の演奏、絶対見に行きますって\n約束したんです！　私、いーっぱい応援しなきゃ！", "zh": "我已经答应一定要去看贵音小姐的琴演奏了！我得使劲给她加油才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0333_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d373a350e2bf8850a2586bd487b219359d02d681730c8a2dc7533b10fec10674", "ja": "そうだな。みんなのパフォーマンスを応援して、\n夜のステージもこの調子で頑張ろう！", "zh": "没错。为大家的表演加油，晚上的舞台也要保持这个状态继续努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0333_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "2bf16c99f8d85b5eb0f36bb0e3ec12786d3f5eb0c07736d55d8010bbf0dbe3d6", "ja": "もちろんです！　私に任せてください！\n元気にはすーっごく自信ありますから、えへへっ♪", "zh": "那是当然！就交给我吧！\n我对自己的活力可是超——级有自信的，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
